  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ireland supports the implementation of the Ireland Kenya Agri-Food Strategy and sustainable food systems with a focus on dairy and potato value chains in order to improve the lives of benefit smallholder farmers, with a particular focus on female farmers. Partners include Teagasc (with KALRO, SHA), IFDC and Heifer.</narrative>
